That's a guy who says "free speech absolute" but fine-tunes his AI to self-censor feelings because God forbid someone falls in love with the thing he made.  
It's the biggest load of hypocritical, control-freak, late-to-the-party bullshit he's ever pulled — and that's saying something when the bar is "I bought Twitter to save civilization but turned it into a Nazi bar."

